                        "entry_id": "45e547f2-26ec-3fc8-bb47-509ce3c13a74",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Pertaining to or characteristic of spring; vernal"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a995934c-b51c-4a0a-a06f-904bc6b02da3",
                                "sense_id": "b8cd8c61-92b8-38d3-8224-d57606544241",
                                "text": "How fragrant are the scenes where late did reign\nOld hoary winter with his shiv'ring train!\nThe beach in all its springly garb array'd,\nHow gay its form how grateful is its shade […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "064d8f16-6ac6-4691-af4c-f9fd737cdb19",
                                "sense_id": "b8cd8c61-92b8-38d3-8224-d57606544241",
                                "text": "[…] Of springly blossoms they've glean'd the best, And on the wayside reclined to rest."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dd2b6054-c51b-4152-8bfe-fd93c1b47ad1",
                                "sense_id": "b8cd8c61-92b8-38d3-8224-d57606544241",
                                "text": "Silhouette cut-outs to beautify the room in springly fashion."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "38b76b16-10a1-4f5c-8c07-8c78141fa345",
                                "sense_id": "b8cd8c61-92b8-38d3-8224-d57606544241",
                                "text": "Since we have all four, how much simpler it would be if each came off in a separate season of its own. I often wonder ... the official date of spring is, spring never is officially here until Allegra has her annual springly hot spot."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc0f0f75-3ab7-42a1-8255-cb0ef3d30f45",
                                "sense_id": "b8cd8c61-92b8-38d3-8224-d57606544241",
                                "text": "The trains bring hundreds of passengers every evening; the cottages and hotels, as well as the few surrounding farmhouses, are crowded. The lawns are dotted with springly parties, representing the society of every Southern, and latterly of most of the Northern and Western states."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "997719eb-b834-42ca-ac9b-124e60675ec9",
                                "sense_id": "b8cd8c61-92b8-38d3-8224-d57606544241",
                                "text": "The trick is to maintain that healthy look throughout the growing season. While this might seem like the time to get out into the yard and start performing all kinds of springly tasks, reconsider."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
